      "text": "Add $n$ to both sides to eliminate the absolute value sign, yielding $n + 6 = -(2 - n) = -2 + n$. We can then subtract $n$ and add $2$ to both sides to isolate $n$, leading to $n + 6 - n + 2 = -2 + n - n + 2$, or $n + 8 = 0$. This implies that $n = -\\boxed{8}$.",
